    "Name": "Whitworth WTH-K",
    "Details": "A somewhat mediocre Scout and Light Strike platform, the Whitworth has been in service across the Inner Sphere since the end of the Age of War. A 40-ton Mech, the Whitworth is powered by a 160-rated Fusion Core and mounts 5 Improved Jump Jets. The Whitworth WTH-K is armed with a pair of MML-7’s. A C3 Slave rounds out the variant.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
